# <type>(<scope>): <subject>            ← imperative mood, ≤72 chars, no trailing period
#
# <body — what changed and why. Wrap at 72. Explain the reasoning, not the diff.>
#
# <footer — Closes #123 / Refs FR-PLAY-03 / BREAKING CHANGE: …>
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Types:   feat  fix  docs  refactor  perf  test  chore  ml  build  ci
# Scopes:  api  web  player  worker  ml  infra  docs  contracts  eval  security
#
# ml     — model, loss, training or evaluation changes (own review criteria)
# perf   — performance without behaviour change
# chore  — tooling, deps, repo maintenance
#
# Reference a requirement ID where one applies: [FR-PLAY-03], [NFR-ML-01]
#
# GRANULARITY: one commit per completed unit of work — a feature, component,
# stage or fix. Not per file, not per phase. Push at phase boundaries.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ATTRIBUTION POLICY
# Commits are authored solely by the repository owner. Do not add Co-Authored-By
# trailers, "Generated with" footers, or any AI-tool attribution. See CLAUDE.md.
